ion of a polymorphic walking robot","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S03-088.36-038180","year":"2014","yearsub":"2014"}
{"abstract":"Concerns with sustainability are providing an increasingly powerful impetus towards the investigation of dynamic and adaptive architectures. This presents an increased overlap with the discipline of Robotics making collaboration between the two fields interesting and potentially fruitful. This paper presents cross-disciplinary work-in-progress that is investigating how standard materials might be organised and processed in novel ways to promote active physical transform of architectural structures and to assess the impact that multi-scalar shape change might have upon environmental performance. This work builds upon prior research investigating tensegrities and other pneumatics including free-form inflated metal.","author_count":7,"contributors":["Ayres, Phil","Støy, Kasper","Stasiuk, David","Gibbons, Hollie"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-126803"],"event":{"end":"2014-02-15","place":"Zurich, ch","start":"2014-02-14","title":"FABRICATE 2014","year":"2014"},"filters":{"added":"2023-01","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Adaptive architecture","Digital design","Fabrication","Pneumatics","Steering","Tensegrity","metal inflation"],"level":"sci","mra":["soc"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-ART","DI-U"],"level3":{"ART":["DI-ART-ALL","DI-ART-RDKA"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-ITU"]},"level3all":["DI-ART-RDKA","DI-U-ITU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"multi scalar shape change in pneumatically steered tensegrities","src":["arkc"],"src-code":["DI-ART-RDKA"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"http://www.fabricate2014.org/","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-126803","ids":["arkc-516de337-d908-4ae4-bba2-3647db89af3f"],"keyword":["No","adaptive architecture","digital design","fabrication","metal inflation","pneumatics","steering","tensegrity"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Social Science"],"noi":["Local-1-1-76870AA56E25CA91EAF7100CA5C12A50"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"http://www.fabricate2014.org/","version":"Other Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"royal danish academy architecture design conservation","l2":"DI-ART","l2n":"Artistic Higher Education Institutions","l3":"DI-ART-RDKA","l3nn":"Royal Danish Academy - Architecture, Design, Conservation","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Royal Danish Academy - Architecture, Design, Conservation","namevar":["Royal Danish Academy - Architecture, Design, Conservation, Royal Danish Academy - Architecture, Institute of Architecture and Technology","Royal Danish Academy - Architecture, Design, Conservation, Royal Danish Academy - Architecture, Institute of Architecture and Technology, CITA - Centre for Information Technology and Architecture","The Royal Danish Academy of Fine Arts, Schools of Architecture, Design and Conservation","The Royal Danish Academy of Fine Arts, Schools of Architecture, Design and Conservation, School of Architecture"],"nora_code":"DI-ART-RDKA","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"itu it university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-ITU","l3nl":"IT University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","namevar":["IT University of Copenhagen"],"nora_code":"DI-U-ITU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Phil","key":"ayrespau","last":"Ayres","locid":"809e3672-ddc8-44e7-8a1b-1c1309974305","name":"Ayres, Phil","orcid":"0000-0002-9266-065X","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Kasper","key":"støypau","last":"Støy","name":"Støy, Kasper","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"David","key":"stasiukpau","last":"Stasiuk","locid":"dcb8d72b-bf7d-476c-a236-c5b43dad4e53","name":"Stasiuk, David","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Hollie","key":"gibbonspau","last":"Gibbons","name":"Gibbons, Hollie","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Fabio","key":"gramaziopedh","last":"Gramazio","name":"Gramazio, Fabio","rank":5,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Matthias","key":"kohlerpedh","last":"Kohler","name":"Kohler, Matthias","rank":6,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Silke","key":"langenbergpedh","last":"Langenberg","name":"Langenberg, Silke","rank":7,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"}],"pub":{"isbn":["9783856763312"],"pages":"256-265","place":"Zurich","status":"p","subtitle":"Negotiating Design and Making","title":"Fabricate"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["All Artistic Higher Education Institutions","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","Artistic Higher Education Institutions","DI-ALL","DI-ART","DI-ART-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","IT University of Copenhagen","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["arkc-516de337-d908-4ae4-bba2-3647db89af3f"],"src":["Royal Danish Academy - Architecture, Design, Conservation"],"title":"Multi-Scalar shape change in pneumatically steered tensegrities","type":"Conference Paper","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-126803","year":"2014","yearsub":"2014"}
{"abstract":"The EVOBLISS project combines scientific approaches from robotics, artificial intelligence, chemistry, and microbiology and aims to capitalize on the state of the art in these disparate disciplines and combine them together into a coherent project to produce i) a generally useful, expandable and customizable technical platform for the artificial evolution of new materials and applications based on a real-time feedback robotic workstation and ii) a specific improved technology, namely a microbial fuel cell, that incorporates natural as well as artificial macro-, micro-, and nanoscale elements for improved function. Scientifically, we will investigate the possibility of optimizing artificial chemical life, microbial ecosystems, and nanoparticles and their physiochemical, dynamic environments using robot facilitated, artificial evolution. This paper deals with the first goal of the EVOBLISS project, to produce a useful, expandable and customizable technical platform for the artificial evolution of new materials and applications. Specifically, the objective of this paper is to define the capabilities of our liquid handling robot, called EvoBot. This robot will be a mature and robust version of the SplotBot robot which was used to show the feasibility of this approach [1]. This robot was able to perform proof of concept experiments, but was too fragile to conduct systematic scientific experiments in artificial chemical life. Furthermore, the EvoBot robot will increase the features of the SplotBot robot in order to make new types of experiments. Proceeding, the capabilities of the EvoBots are presented based on prerequisites for mature and robust functionality, and also features requested by partners.","author_count":3,"contributors":["Faina, Andres","Nejatimoharrami, Farzad","Støy, Kasper"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-382578"],"event":{"end":"2014-08-30","place":"New York, us","start":"2014-08-30","title":"Exploiting synergies between biology and artificial life technologies: tools, possibilities, and examples","year":"2014"},"filters":{"added":"2024-06","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Liquid handling","Robotics"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-ITU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-ITU"]},"review":"nr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"towards evobot a liquid handling robot able to automatize and optimize experiments based on real time feedback","src":["itu"],"src-code":["DI-U-ITU"],"type":"dca","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://pure.itu.dk/ws/files/76542200/ALIFE14_evobot.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-382578","ids":["itu-584b4e9b-e442-40db-b0fe-15de3ea843b5"],"keyword":["Liquid handling","Robotics"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-525DFDFA72F908D490D5CADB52484388"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://pure.itu.dk/ws/files/76542200/ALIFE14_evobot.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"itu it university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-ITU","l3nl":"IT University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","namevar":["IT University of Copenhagen, Computer Science","IT University of Copenhagen, Data, Systems, and Robotics, Robotics, Evolution, and Art Lab","The Department, Software & Systems"],"nora_code":"DI-U-ITU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Andres","key":"fainapau","last":"Faina","locid":"7dd48cfe-3069-4563-bef4-ef661c18387a","name":"Faina, Andres","orcid":"0000-0001-7288-6988","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Farzad","key":"nejatimoharramipau","last":"Nejatimoharrami","name":"Nejatimoharrami, Farzad","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Kasper","key":"støypau","last":"Støy","locid":"2a9c0934-98ca-4101-b829-b88d77f6487e","name":"Støy, Kasper","orcid":"0000-0003-0179-2487","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"status":"p"},"review":"No Review","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","IT University of Copenhagen","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["itu-584b4e9b-e442-40db-b0fe-15de3ea843b5"],"src":["ITU IT University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Towards EvoBot: A liquid-handling robot able to automatize and optimize experiments based on real-time feedback","type":"Conference Abstract","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-382578","year":"2014","yearsub":"2014"}
