{"abstract":"This paper presents experiments with a morphologyindependent, life-long strategy for online learning of locomotion gaits, performed on a quadruped robot build using the LockKit robotic building kit. The learning strategy applies a stochastic optimization algorithm to optimize eight open parameters of a central pattern generator based gait implementation. We observe that the strategy converges in roughly ten minutes to gaits of similar or higher velocity than a manually designed gait and that the strategy readapts in the event of failed actuators. In future work we plan to study co-learning of morphological and control parameters directly on the physical robot.","author_count":3,"contributors":["Christensen, David Johan","Larsen, Jørgen Christian","Stoy, Kasper"],"cuid":["S02-080.02-036427"],"event":{"end":"2012-05-18","place":"Madrid, es","start":"2012-05-17","title":"2012 IEEE Conference on Evolving and Adaptive Intelligent Systems","year":"2012"},"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"keyword":["Actuators","Biology","Legged locomotion","Manuals"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-DTU","DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"adaptive strategy for online gait learning evaluated on the polymorphic robotic locokit","src":["dtu","sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU","DI-U-SDU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1109/EAIS.2012.6232806","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S02-080.02-036427","identifier":[{"id":"84864835625","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["dtu-a8c823df-f676-431f-a525-086957fd735f","sdu-4fab5907-716a-4fa9-a6c9-4460bc572e52"],"keyword":["Actuators","Biology","Legged locomotion","Manuals."],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"no